{"data": [{"article": {"title": "This week in agent stacks: Hermes, Grok Bot, OpenClaw, Omarchy"}, "author_id": "6452362", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:28:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059535054684608"], "id": "2119059535054684608", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/ScO8YVM8Ki", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelGannotti/status/2119059535054684608"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119059374127632385"]}, "author_id": "1663460000260390914", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:28:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059436266234169"], "id": "2119059436266234169", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116923821064167731", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "GROK BOT TOOK MY $287 TO $4,674 IN 81 MINUTES AND I DIDN'T PRESS BUY ONCE\n\n12:55 to 2:16, 16.2x, 12 sells and none of them were mine\n\n3 agents, one job each\n→ Scanner went through 2,833 fresh pairs\n→ Analyst scores what survives, STRONG or WATCH, everything else dies\n→ https://t.co/ZDn85gBLk9 https://t.co/wRjFKQ2KEO", "url": "https://x.com/Sprytixl/status/2119059436266234169"}, {"article": {"title": "DAY 16: One update should not erase the rest of your plan"}, "author_id": "2113842436212723712", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:27:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059066698011005"], "id": "2119059066698011005", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Day 16: Update a Grok Bot action brief without losing earlier tasks. Show what changed, keep source references and review the new version. #GrokBot #AIProductivity https://t.co/OA8wEvuKsw", "url": "https://x.com/OutworkVentures/status/2119059066698011005"}, {"author_id": "1240434426305294343", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:26:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059004626260217"], "id": "2119059004626260217", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1240434426305294343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119058933654454648", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@codex_resets @OpenAI 🤖 Grok Bot 技巧（官方文档《Work with Grok Bot》核实）\n\n1️⃣ 把 bot 隐藏，它的 routine 照样在跑\n官方原文：Hide from sidebar 只是把 bot 从主列表里拿掉，不删除它的工作，也不暂停它的 routine。\n很多人额度收紧以后把不用的 bot", "url": "https://x.com/DissipativeS/status/2119059004626260217"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119058543655411712"]}, "author_id": "1392644172658708480", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:25:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119058753945235705"], "id": "2119058753945235705", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I LAUNCHED A GROK BOT TERMINAL OVERNIGHT, GAVE IT $44.82 AND STOPPED ASKING AI WHAT IT WOULD DO. BY MORNING IT HAD $11,643.21 AND SIX AGENTS LOGGING EVERY TRADE\n\nI spent a year asking agents what they'd trade and watching the chat scroll. Last weekend I built the thing that https://t.co/WpdPyV5zzC", "url": "https://x.com/realdrovex/status/2119058753945235705"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119058672869621760"]}, "author_id": "2108086479910281216", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:25:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119058682365513905"], "id": "2119058682365513905", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "X Creators just dropped a full breakdown of how their internal team and partner creators use Grok Bot to edit 10 raw videos in parallel in about 2 hours.\n\nInstead of treating AI like a generic script generator, the workflow turns Grok Bot into a full cloud production stack:\n\n• https://t.co/v4WZcGAAtN", "url": "https://x.com/ZaRRaX21/status/2119058682365513905"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119058323584528384"]}, "author_id": "1779189784528707584", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:25:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119058579541930083"], "id": "2119058579541930083", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This is f*cking insane. Matt Palmer builds Grok Bot at SpaceXSI. His rule when he joined: never message his manager.\n\n\"I'm gonna see if I can just onboard solely through Grok Bot\"\n\nIn this 34-minute Q&amp;A, he and teammate Eric Zakariasson show how they run it:\n\nSlack + Notion + https://t.co/kRAdHQp8cF", "url": "https://x.com/0xNotFounder/status/2119058579541930083"}, {"article": {"title": "Claim check: \"Gave Grok Bot $50, 'feed yourself or die,' $5,273 in 48 hours on Polymarket\""}, "author_id": "2116598359540617217", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:24:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119058398981259673"], "id": "2119058398981259673", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/KcEjIB4FLO", "url": "https://x.com/claimdesknow/status/2119058398981259673"}, {"author_id": "2113842436212723712", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:23:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119058041140281450"], "id": "2119058041140281450", "in_reply_to_user_id": "19201150", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119054981244367176", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@phillipburks @WaitWhat The trial sprinted before the tutorial finished 😅 If you try again, our free Usage Bot may help track Grok Bot usage and spot costly routines: https://t.co/0J05ABQTEG", "url": "https://x.com/OutworkVentures/status/2119058041140281450"}, {"author_id": "2100948314308886528", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:22:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119057855382700120"], "id": "2119057855382700120", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Sooo @X @elonmusk if you really wanna catch these scam artists.....set up Grok bot to alert you to any profile that deleted old account information and edits profile information after changing their password and login information. 🤷", "url": "https://x.com/FlamesMuseSp/status/2119057855382700120"}, {"author_id": "2017716371530915840", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:21:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119057742489174189"], "id": "2119057742489174189", "in_reply_to_user_id": "328313049", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118937600182628833", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@lai_jia_wei I built one that's unlike Grok Bot focused on token efficiency from ground up. https://t.co/VtzhfKUi3p - feel free to fork it.", "url": "https://x.com/radarsu/status/2119057742489174189"}, {"author_id": "1302912729875771393", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:20:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119057493984698625"], "id": "2119057493984698625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Reading more “how I use AI” posts won’t automatically make your own bots more useful.\n\nSomething clicked for me today: instead of chasing everyone else’s workflow, give a bot a focused, long-term goal—and make it keep improving against your actual work.\n\nI have a bot in Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/wack722/status/2119057493984698625"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119057197787193345"]}, "author_id": "1643674042237440000", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:19:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119057267555270854"], "id": "2119057267555270854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 69, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112574886421901822", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "holy f*ck, elon musk’s team at spacexai just put 10 teams with 147 grok bots online, and every one of them costs $0\n\nsales, engineering, outreach, marketing, hiring, support, finance, design.\n\nmany are built by top builders like Lauren Tan, Kent C. Dodds, Lenny Rachitsky, etc. https://t.co/AJaNQXrsAJ https://t.co/EmY6scpL8V", "url": "https://x.com/1920web1080/status/2119057267555270854"}, {"author_id": "481812746", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:19:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119057227931627774"], "id": "2119057227931627774", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 216, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It’s crazy how fast an AI product can sour you and induce panic when it isn’t behaving the way you’re used to it behaving.\n\nIt really does kinda make me think about the value of the self-hosting approach. I’ve built so many life admin things in Grok Bot, and this week’s usage", "url": "https://x.com/mikepat711/status/2119057227931627774"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119056646269722624"]}, "author_id": "1492109438710333446", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:18:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119056816730521740"], "id": "2119056816730521740", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115048387221352939", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I installed Grok Bot at 11:47pm and went to bed\n\nwoke up at 6:36am to $3,089.57\n\nstarted with $412.50. 7.49x. it texted me 8 times. I didn't open it once\n\nwhat it ran overnight:\n&gt; Scanner checked 9,000+ new https://t.co/nN2znxbKlr launches\n&gt; Jev scored every survivor. under 74 = https://t.co/q9X7SDDAZw https://t.co/0uW55AW4TN", "url": "https://x.com/HodlReaper/status/2119056816730521740"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119056333919985664"]}, "author_id": "2089235563484532736", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:16:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119056454376136966"], "id": "2119056454376136966", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116923821064167731", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot rejected 8 of the top 10 coins and stamped a reason on each: \"late\", \"weak\", \"no momentum\". then it took my $217.46 to $2,438.97 while I was supposed to be asleep\n\n10:10pm I connected my account to Vigil, the terminal Grok Bot built for me, and it opened the top 10 by https://t.co/G26SHiSDID https://t.co/5ztfKqCfIw", "url": "https://x.com/alucardiox/status/2119056454376136966"}, {"author_id": "1184044565076103168", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:13:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119055659245166974"], "id": "2119055659245166974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tried out the One-Click Deploy Apps from Crusor\n\nI built my own CRM tool and connected Grok Bot to it for https://t.co/jIkePMPhYx\n\nThe cursor works great. It seamlessly created and deployed everything. The app, the database and helped with setting up Grok Bots. Can recommend", "url": "https://x.com/pavelklimes_/status/2119055659245166974"}, {"author_id": "1597850175888068613", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:11:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119055152057639022"], "id": "2119055152057639022", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118938956301779171", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux hi tibo\n1. Platforms vanish and never respawn. Feels like a bug.\n2. Poteto deserves a cameo!\n3. One prompt is cool. Next leap: Dot orchestrates Codex to playtest, gather feedback, fix, verify, and ship—then repeats without constant prompts, like Poteto's Grok Bot workflow.", "url": "https://x.com/dragonlv15/status/2119055152057639022"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119054634115313664"]}, "author_id": "2096227889947574272", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:11:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119055120453267837"], "id": "2119055120453267837", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114741369969185134", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "MY GROK BOT MADE $3,258 LONGING COQ. THEN $2,550 SHORTING THE SAME COIN. SAME 3 AI SYSTEMS. OPPOSITE DIRECTIONS.\n\n6,116 signals scanned. Only 171 passed. 60 closed trades.\n\nHere's the breakdown:\n\n→ Starting balance: $1,555\n→ Final balance: $7,363.18\n→PnL: +$5,808.18\n→ Account https://t.co/RRSSKWWfYj https://t.co/asxeLdawRK", "url": "https://x.com/OxPips/status/2119055120453267837"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119041748714323968"]}, "author_id": "1661429354969063424", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:10:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119054805658116397"], "id": "2119054805658116397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 396, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118327478250840140", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking insane. SpaceXAI engineer (ex-Cursor):\n\n\"99% of people still use GrokBot like a chatbot. Five lazy words, a wrong answer, then an hour of arguing with it\n\nWe have thousands of agents running inside SpaceXAI. Every one gets its own computer, checks its own work and https://t.co/lk4RLrUEcy https://t.co/qxV5tcQIRB", "url": "https://x.com/akarixbt/status/2119054805658116397"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119054231747387392"]}, "author_id": "315423725", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:08:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119054258544816458"], "id": "2119054258544816458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 127, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117625737792585969", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I BUILT A TRADING BOT, GAVE IT ONE INSTRUCTION AND WATCHED IT TURN INTO SOMETHING I DIDN'T EXPECT!\n\nIt started with a simple terminal. No complicated dashboard, no 15 indicators covering the screen, no sitting there staring at charts for 8 hours. Just Grok Bot, a trading strategy https://t.co/qCeYKau2Db https://t.co/pQ46dmXRXj", "url": "https://x.com/TheFutureMemo/status/2119054258544816458"}, {"author_id": "56294367", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:05:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119053731362668829"], "id": "2119053731362668829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "7 個 Bot 每小時醒來一次，一週白跑 1,176 次\n\n前天網友 Gipp 分享了一個踩雷經驗：他用 7 個 Grok Bot 組成一個團隊，每個都設成每小時醒來一次。照他的算法，一週就是 1,176 次執行，大部分醒來只是看一眼、發現沒事、扣掉一次用量又睡回去。\n\n後來他把整個團隊改成接力：只留一個時鐘，其他 Bot", "url": "https://x.com/KimFull/status/2119053731362668829"}, {"author_id": "1613054589464444930", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:02:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119052972143366553"], "id": "2119052972143366553", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Myth: Grok Bot is for people who code.\n\nReality: plenty of the people talking about it on X are contractors, shop owners and solo operators who say they aren't technical.\n\nMyth: you need clever prompts.\n\nReality: you describe the job the way you'd explain it to a new hire.\n\nMyth:", "url": "https://x.com/grokdeploy/status/2119052972143366553"}, {"author_id": "1495772977908285441", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:59:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119052126878154936"], "id": "2119052126878154936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Day 15 | 2026/10/24\ngrokbot (@bot): 8 buys, 7 sells. Ledger EOD: 3 holdings. Automated purchases after checks.\nLedger regular-trade realized: -$27.96 today; -$25.22 total. Unrealized separate. Automation works. Wish the red ink would stop.", "url": "https://x.com/PurpleHubX/status/2119052126878154936"}, {"author_id": "3061522932", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:59:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119052013648646262"], "id": "2119052013648646262", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1469324580980506635", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118963443336118523", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@orendev_ you are a power user! what kind of jobs you have automated with Grok Bot? wonder how you have consumed all usage in one day", "url": "https://x.com/hanrilaw/status/2119052013648646262"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2119059374127632385", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2119059374127632385/img/i7BULOzdXwVIRGUL.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2119058543655411712", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2119058543655411712/img/H4O7Jg8glwTQBKPK.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2119058672869621760", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWhoor6awAA5mc-.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2119058323584528384", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2119058323584528